  "goodToKnow": "Der Kiesel or Kieselstein is a pebble: flache Kiesel übers Wasser springen lassen (to skim stones). Der Kies is gravel, and colloquially money (dough): Er hat viel Kies. Die Kiesgrube is a gravel pit, often later a swimming lake (Baggersee). Kieselsäure (silica) is in many supplements. Plural: die Kiesel, dative den Kieseln."
